STATUS: ENABLED
REASON: Normal operation
UPDATED: 2025-11-04

# Workflow Kill Switch
#
# To disable workflows in case of emergency:
# 1. Change STATUS to DISABLED
# 2. Update REASON with explanation
# 3. Commit and push
#
# Workflows affected:
# - Automatic merges (automerge job in ci.yml)
# - Releases and promotion to main (release.yml)
# CI validation keeps running.
#
# To re-enable:
# 1. Change STATUS to ENABLED
# 2. Update REASON to "Normal operation"
# 3. Commit and push
